flowchart TB
    subgraph W["Written once, read by everyone"]
        direction LR
        GR[Global rules file] --- AG[AGENTS file:<br/>a pointer for each tool]
    end
    subgraph S["One per stage"]
        direction TB
        SP[Stage spec] --> RV1[Spec review findings]
        SP --> RP[Builder report,<br/>one per Part]
        RP --> RV2[Code review findings]
        RV2 --> FX[Fix request with the<br/>planner's decisions]
    end
    subgraph K["Kept up to date all the time"]
        direction TB
        ST[Status file] --> HO[Handover for<br/>the next session]
        LG[Logs: sessions,<br/>decisions] --> HO
        TK[Ticket board] --> HO
    end
    W --> S
    S --> K
